        <mxCell id="Ok_oPfVutxxGbshZokRG-14" value="The second part of the proposal would be to change the heartbeat to a broadcast message received by all DFO instances in the session, and have the MLT broadcast its TriggerDecisions to all DFOs as well. An &quot;activate DFO&quot; command sent by Run Control would select the current DFO, and it would then have all relevant information for assigning outstanding Trigger Decisions." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" y="520" width="510" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
